\pard\qc\b\fs36 B\u192?I N\u7896?P \u8211? VU DUC CHAU\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql\par
B\u224?i t\u7853?p: Ti\u7875?u lu\u7853?n \u8211? Qu\u7843?n tr\u7883? d\u7919? li\u7879?u v\u224? ch\u7845?t l\u432?\u7907?ng d\u7919? li\u7879?u\par
Lo\u7841?i b\u224?i: Ti\u7875?u lu\u7853?n\par
Sinh vi\u234?n: Vu Duc Chau (25380030)\par
L\u7899?p h\u7885?c ph\u7847?n: MIS2101-02\par
H\u7885?c ph\u7847?n: MIS2101 \u8211? Management Information Systems\par
\par
N\u7897?i dung t\u243?m t\u7855?t:\par
B\u224?i l\u224?m \u273?\u432?\u7907?c tr\u236?nh b\u224?y theo c\u7845?u tr\u250?c y\u234?u c\u7847?u c\u7911?a gi\u7843?ng vi\u234?n, c\u243? ph\u226?n t\u237?ch v\u224? khuy\u7871?n ngh\u7883?.\par
S\u7889? li\u7879?u v\u224? v\u237? d\u7909? minh h\u7885?a \u273?\u432?\u7907?c t\u7893?ng h\u7907?p t\u7915? t\u224?i li\u7879?u h\u7885?c ph\u7847?n.\par
\par
L\u432?u \u253?: d\u7919? li\u7879?u minh h\u7885?a \u8211? kh\u244?ng ph\u7843?i b\u224?i n\u7897?p th\u7853?t c\u7911?a sinh vi\u234?n.\par
